{"t":"USB","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"U.S. Bancorp","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","employees":70000,"hq":"Minneapolis, MN, United States","website":"https://www.usbank.com","summary_en":"U.S. Bancorp, a financial services holding company, provides various financial services to individuals, businesses, institutional organizations, governmental entities, and other financial institutions in the United States. The company operates through Wealth, Corporate, Commercial and Institutional Banking; Consumer and Business Banking; Payment Services; and Treasury and Corporate Support segments. It offers depository services, including checking accounts, savings accounts, and time certificate contracts; and lending services, such as traditional credit products and credit card services, lease financing and import/export trade, agricultural finance, asset-backed lending, and other products. The company also provides cash management, capital markets, and trust and investment management services; and ancillary services comprising capital markets, treasury management, and receivable lock-box collection services to corporate and governmental entity customers. In addition, it offers asset management and fiduciary services for individuals, estates, foundations, business corporations, and charitable organizations; and investment and insurance products to its customers principally within its domestic markets, as well as fund administration services to mutual and other funds. Further, the company provides corporate and purchasing card, and corporate trust services; and credit card services, merchant and ATM processing, mortgage banking, insurance, brokerage and leasing services. U.S. Bancorp was founded in 1863 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"금융 서비스 지주 회사인 U.S. Bancorp는 미국 내 개인, 기업, 기관 조직, 정부 기관 및 기타 금융 기관에 다양한 금융 서비스를 제공합니다. 회사는 자산, 기업, 상업 및 기관 금융을 통해 운영됩니다. 소비자 및 기업 금융; 결제 서비스; 재무부 및 기업 지원 부문. 당좌 예금 계좌, 저축 계좌 및 정기 증명서 계약을 포함한 예금 서비스를 제공합니다. 전통적인 신용상품 및 신용카드 서비스, 리스금융 및 수출입 무역, 농업금융, 자산담보대출 및 기타 상품과 같은 대출 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 현금 관리, 자본 시장, 신탁 및 투자 관리 서비스도 제공합니다. 기업 및 정부 기관 고객을 위한 자본 시장, 재무 관리, 미수금 보관함 수금 서비스로 구성된 보조 서비스도 포함됩니다. 또한 개인, 부동산, 재단, 기업 및 자선 단체를 위한 자산 관리 및 수탁 서비스를 제공합니다. 주로 국내 시장 고객에게 투자 및 보험 상품을 제공하고 뮤추얼 및 기타 펀드에 대한 펀드 관리 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한, 회사는 법인카드 및 구매카드, 기업신탁 서비스를 제공합니다. 신용 카드 서비스, 가맹점 및 ATM 처리, 모기지 뱅킹, 보험, 중개 및 임대 서비스. US Bancorp는 1863년에 설립되었으며 미네소타주 미니애폴리스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":57.6,"mcap":89752821760.0,"pe":11.206225,"fpe":9.828445,"peg":1.4128,"ps":3.2185621,"pb":1.5054493,"ev_ebitda":null,"div":3.71,"beta":1.026,"hi52":66.08,"lo52":46.43},"fin":{"rev":27886000128.0,"rev_g":0.084,"eps_g":0.102,"gross":0.0,"op":0.39266998,"net":0.30010998,"roe":0.12843001,"fcf":null,"cash":55005999104.0,"debt":78713004032.0,"de":null,"eps":5.14,"feps":5.86054},"own":{"short":0.0001,"inst":0.86086,"insider":0.00228},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":68.79545,"median":68.5,"high":75.0,"low":65.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.79167,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":13,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":13,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":66.0,"priorPriceTarget":64.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Oppenheimer","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":74.0,"priorPriceTarget":73.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":65.5,"priorPriceTarget":65.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Citigroup","To